{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "sourceId": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-16",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "sourceSha256": "b4aaae151abfd30c5dd561252391884f7712b974996b265eb959d98c1b87e28b",
  "scope": "Complete simplified-Chinese chapter text supplied by the edition, with no new translation or silent character correction.",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "从此东南行。 减八十由延。 经历诸寺甚多。 僧众万数。",
      "textSha256": "cfdc79c911a771ad0ee5192f91e31012529e379d64b2b992dbd3fd8ccd864281",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[1]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 423,
          "endByte": 502,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "cbed025eef9ff3fcfc23a3523ee38e7f7001af95b1006addbf9c23acb97c321a"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "过是诸处已。 到一国。 国名摩头罗。",
      "textSha256": "624cb32f52e394fea765ed91fd9ef53da540c53222e567a5b58447535101db3f",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[2]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 910,
          "endByte": 964,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "ae0ab1865c4e23c48152f72745cfda191ed24068089b637b6b2e2010fb431658"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "又经蒱那河。 河边左右。 有二十僧伽蓝。 可有三千僧。 佛法转盛。",
      "textSha256": "c6e72c420b3d45b6283ca57f2dec8757bfe91b2a4413380d20e4d786e2a73116",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[3]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 1426,
          "endByte": 1521,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "27506110eebd873ac6470214daff983dc3bf6982ba66a1d66bd33405c26e9df6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "凡沙河已西。 天竺诸国。 国王皆笃信佛法。",
      "textSha256": "91e02cd2201529bf7142092570436c8474c10211778bc14e0e8a7af69f248bf8",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[4]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 1970,
          "endByte": 2033,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "cad317e9e7d958857b51b0deb9f8e49a0850dd9bc69a460bcdf1b57e2a2eaeba"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 5,
      "text": "供养众僧时。 则脱天冠。 共诸宗亲群臣。 手自行食。",
      "textSha256": "29866ff8834bc43e48b5c4b455ca6766a98f03a799788ce7f98672acc97ade73",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[5]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2401,
          "endByte": 2477,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "00c18eb438b80c803632d4a792a9a85e14ec4b6ff23c57a7bb764b88e892dc17"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 6,
      "text": "行食已。 铺毡于地。 对上座前。 坐于众僧前。 不敢坐床。",
      "textSha256": "bd539faa85db884f61b377389bac3c700442178b4a0df5897271a0c373968adb",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[6]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2882,
          "endByte": 2965,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "83ff95e2fc4dbaad66a08ec3574e476416d5472adf30033f43a4089c17e40c3e"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 7,
      "text": "佛在世时。 诸王供养法式。 相传至今。",
      "textSha256": "b5a183f8fd9c27c3e8730895e0a02cea757330a3c4161b1cd0348a84c899e3ed",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[7]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 3359,
          "endByte": 3416,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "d95d5d6af0e658cc16a1a5e86e01ca1c188aeb331038c25e69d73228142147c8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 8,
      "text": "从是以南。 名为中国。 中国寒暑调和。 无霜雪。",
      "textSha256": "666e7666df30d6697621b348a17b3a3fda0c2479e32b39298075a136cc1200e9",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[8]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 3770,
          "endByte": 3840,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "3c50b52c702810d2ca53f40d5647425d3af3e9dbdc137940eedce62a375426e1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 9,
      "text": "人民殷乐。 无户籍官法。 唯耕王地者。 乃输地利。",
      "textSha256": "2c87dcaa666169083b5c5afb146fc1d535515fe41e551a25e19eefeea5f35b08",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[9]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4264,
          "endByte": 4337,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "3235574706624b3cf9176c5d4388909c28c34e13b4ca297fac44eb10d4957e4c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 10,
      "text": "欲去便去。 欲住便住。",
      "textSha256": "4fd0078a9760abe2733aaed367b2b9ca229a5bed85b11bd02fcdb408fc1ff67d",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[10]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4617,
          "endByte": 4652,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "79e704f748ba68164207be173c36c7447e90a0d1379cdaf6a4b20cb5cc4aad5f"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 11,
      "text": "王治不用刑斩有罪者。 但罚其钱。 随事轻重。",
      "textSha256": "5dcb9c291da6c3ac6f7e26ff5bab6191d237e5b2bcaea48f92b819a1cd320505",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[11]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4949,
          "endByte": 5015,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "2dc4a8d22d549214a314859e123221b4d2933c3c1286fa9d491aa58f755497aa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 12,
      "text": "虽复谋为恶逆。 不过截右手而已。",
      "textSha256": "985ac595dfba4a3c5a305943f30a2f668f384a4bad6afd56a9a5c0696381a11e",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[12]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5327,
          "endByte": 5377,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "1ae1ff8726293dcbe38a737e1c5796e773f4e85fe3634090596e9067e0ee2607"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 13,
      "text": "王之侍卫左右。 皆有供禄。",
      "textSha256": "db1a5064ddb909ecfe5e58f80e7d03b5365bfd4c260c5530142af9d83144f095",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[13]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5601,
          "endByte": 5642,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "ef5372e99208a1c3a1a94586bec27aa63483b8fc9c03f617e57ea327a3627760"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 14,
      "text": "举国人民。 悉不杀生。 不饮酒。 不食葱蒜。",
      "textSha256": "e95bad659f4711490553a5210476033edee5e9ec75b69d8fa4bb49dd4c36d029",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[14]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5989,
          "endByte": 6053,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "628841528c916c1184eaba4ca5a840549dc6719448c1fc41363b8dfc5e4bfed2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 15,
      "text": "唯除旃荼罗。 旃荼罗名为恶人。 与人别居。",
      "textSha256": "fffa9e1eaddb6154b170e2c9394c3fc19a596432a2f589523359879d2c9bb692",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[15]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 6401,
          "endByte": 6464,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "27857d4b1b5869fd104455c9a3dd87fbf5305f009350e8b373b35acbe79c1528"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 16,
      "text": "若入城市。 则击木以自异。 人则识而避之。 不相搪揬。",
      "textSha256": "a0d2606745bcd9fce6f5da3bd699f17004889dacfc8e637834537b32e9937af5",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[16]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 6841,
          "endByte": 6920,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "eb4e8daf709ffe6d33ae3c4435e0ec2bafc5b169fd36077f522b63949092b8b2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 17,
      "text": "国中不养猪、鸡。 不卖生口。 市无屠店。 及沽酒者。",
      "textSha256": "9f7132d18c6266a6b356cf45e6f47765a2830c29e71899cb63acfa018d247913",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[17]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 7316,
          "endByte": 7392,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "21ff9e6643d326052c43885a39f18857ff1972104b5abb769da6ac28fd9ea381"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 18,
      "text": "货易则用贝齿。 唯旃荼罗。 渔猎师。 卖肉耳。",
      "textSha256": "3e752d977779d167e3f81c6242ca1c4bfd46346f087c74940ebc1b4abe21b742",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[18]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 7735,
          "endByte": 7802,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "d6352f962f9537c8f0a2d88dd4651175c8717a78214b849613cfe49c111a35ea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 19,
      "text": "自佛般泥洹后。 诸国王、长者、居士为众僧起精舍。 供给田宅、园圃、民户、牛犊。 铁券书录。 后王王相传。 无敢废者。 至今不绝。",
      "textSha256": "f88628be44f5534e869b0fb43e1822a229d8b92aa4ad8a50fb914f064bd8a9c0",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[19]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 8528,
          "endByte": 8712,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "929df25c0c86347285862a437e91eedb4b85d84e1f1417daea238b56f4f5449c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 20,
      "text": "众僧住止房舍。 床蓐、饮食、衣服。 都无阙乏。 处处皆尔。",
      "textSha256": "ece3576056044d2f0479fb77c05d5aceae04340de5efbbd4176e3deb58525fc5",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[20]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 9288,
          "endByte": 9373,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "f8bf425273cddcdda805107ea49ccf582e0d20ed8955739011a0bd6eb5bd81f0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 21,
      "text": "众僧常以作功德为业。 及诵经坐禅。",
      "textSha256": "a52268418427528c9f648b96a242b31639eeee015ba72d8dfea2d28f3c74cf5d",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[21]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 9743,
          "endByte": 9796,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "5ff0934ab3b7a77021ef536b7cd988454c8bfa8d053fe47f8c5d0d25d808fcfc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 22,
      "text": "客僧往到。 旧僧迎逆。 代担衣钵。 给洗足水。 涂足油。 与非时浆。",
      "textSha256": "437bdc447d543993f18ef02257dbaa115380803031b1f0e7b236ed1686f57231",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[22]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 10272,
          "endByte": 10368,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "cd652503154a90553596147ff472c8bea1fe56f7f23f2f484ab8cc6a754a3ea0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 23,
      "text": "须臾息已。 复问其腊数。 次第得房舍卧具。 种种如法。",
      "textSha256": "0864463e1cee72e86f527814bd0003c74c02c21c3d4f419dd87a39981f249ac5",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[23]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 10912,
          "endByte": 10991,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "13c5a4c9268b43f153382b7f177707505eb29c366bc421840fff19618d1afa37"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 24,
      "text": "众僧住处。 作舍利弗塔、目连、阿难塔。 幷阿毗昙、律、经塔。",
      "textSha256": "6893c7715d79bdfa41c08e3f6debf5f2c9c4af678a6c13c48284c5d46ad2a921",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[24]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 11952,
          "endByte": 12042,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "508d694875fb35ff1d6ec39d6799e23e1d9d165a664319261f8d2da83a6ab63d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 25,
      "text": "安居后一月。 诸希福之家。 劝化供养僧。 行非时浆。",
      "textSha256": "4ba14759b264b5ac6708376c964404a3d1c571821b5ecf52037e2fe63d25e774",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[25]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 12518,
          "endByte": 12594,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "aef14b49ffe0f29143cdd4fd4bb70db33d8b79b94a8c69351217bd5026751c72"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 26,
      "text": "众僧大会说法。 说法已。 供养舍利弗塔。 种种华香。",
      "textSha256": "c511a2ade9348346b005a7a3213a7a85efa5a313264ca5dced3f7661ea9c3a6b",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[26]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 12998,
          "endByte": 13074,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "7cd73c2a12b3873088d315fcd9c86281cc9d2957adb39207eda3eff50d0bacdc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 27,
      "text": "通夜然灯。 使伎乐人作。",
      "textSha256": "5e26b261374e0355a8f93d44f83b75d1f38461fa05ce30006a461f5a4c5732e6",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[27]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 13398,
          "endByte": 13436,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "98808ab9ed145738eabb15eb1d0fe3ae0d632e67212cd5f176442c8f68057d02"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 28,
      "text": "舍利弗。 大婆罗门时。 诣佛求出家。",
      "textSha256": "54d81d311a5690bd16db69699a648657f5668ce3320a1065eed31fc120c45215",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[28]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 13703,
          "endByte": 13757,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "558e8e00877d63f289cb54bb98e9c1258586139ba9c3a8391d8b8819b3b834f9"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 29,
      "text": "大目连。 大迦叶。 亦如是。",
      "textSha256": "86e815051b47a8a707aa7b121392daa66a092cbb37f78edca7e389a3864d90f1",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[29]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 14062,
          "endByte": 14104,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "6568a9beb846a63c4b0b8b875b53a82942cdb7bdb943b24d4db498856ff97f31"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 30,
      "text": "诸比丘尼。 多供养阿难塔。 以阿难请世尊听女人出家故。",
      "textSha256": "6ebde6f74c3687f2e4f750aacd69a982d5fbdc60b371cd5d8a06dfde954496b4",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[30]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 14587,
          "endByte": 14668,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "6da9bbff5ee901dbb095d357e2514aea0f5b659b07df7acbad0a59f4cafb0843"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 31,
      "text": "诸沙弥。 多供养罗云。",
      "textSha256": "53f35ad112714d2744e87078106eb80561bef4c7051cbacda71d8a2d7b076a0d",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[31]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 15123,
          "endByte": 15158,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "bd613d6004affb038994129adf4e240f81882e6d0a8d3847fd7f37a54764b1a8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 32,
      "text": "阿毗昙师者。 供养阿毗昙。 律师者供养律。",
      "textSha256": "ed6f6322a1c749042544c4c6a6b5901de31aedc5432d98fe70d4482af43bca3e",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[32]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 15377,
          "endByte": 15440,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "6057e2762d46dae128eb97634fa083783edd9c0f416315cdf91cf02b95d6cc0d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 33,
      "text": "年年一供养。 各自有日。",
      "textSha256": "d21590011348fccff511ae51ff715fa2c451554555e2b7399299351d4f3b559a",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[33]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 15711,
          "endByte": 15749,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "c34b0a6181312148c31930363c5ec0387d69326ad180acc80d5eaaebf2c39a60"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 34,
      "text": "摩诃衍人。 则供养般若波罗蜜、文殊师利、观世音等。",
      "textSha256": "3d52f7fd556b880a8b503bd142f0f9465dc00d52daebc62799208aa16d9cc8e3",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[34]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 16331,
          "endByte": 16408,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "1c00e92dbb1b0bf178873d210f2307c45d83fa8346595e3c5de961ad485e0ce2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "segment": 35,
      "text": "众僧受岁竟。 长者居士。 婆罗门等。 各将种种衣物。 沙门所须以用。 布施众僧。",
      "textSha256": "ae5d6fc5fffa056f35d565291eceab7dd4ad6cc9f1c1da0293491879d262dd04",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[35]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 16854,
          "endByte": 16968,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
